@startuml b-seq-failover
title Вариант 2 (Temporal). Failover: push не подтверждён → SMS (провайдер A отказал → B), позднее подтверждение push
autonumber
skinparam responseMessageBelowArrow true
skinparam sequenceMessageAlign left

participant "Temporal\nServer" as T
participant "Delivery Workflow\nWorker" as WW
participant "SMS Activity\nWorker" as SW
participant "SMS-провайдер A" as SA
participant "SMS-провайдер B" as SB
participant "Receipt Collector\n+ Signaler" as RC
actor "Приложение" as APP
queue "Kafka" as K

== Push передан провайдеру, таймер 10 с запущен ==
note over APP : устройство вне сети\nили приложение выгружено ОС
... 10 с без сигнала ...

== Таймаут push: следующий шаг плана ==
T -> WW : workflow task (TimerFired)
WW -> WW : delivered_by is None → шаг 2 (SMS)
WW --> T : ScheduleActivity send(attempt #2)\ntask queue = sms, retry policy: 3 попытки, backoff 1 с
T -> SW : activity send(attempt #2)

== Отказ провайдера A внутри activity ==
SW -> SA : send(client_ref = attempt #2)
SA --> SW : 503
SW -> SW : circuit breaker A → OPEN\n(ошибка однозначная: дубля нет)
SW -> SB : send(client_ref = attempt #2)
SB --> SW : 202 Accepted (provider_message_id)
SW --> T : completed(provider = B)
T -> WW : workflow task
WW --> T : StartTimer(60 с), wait_condition(delivered_by)

== Доставка по SMS ==
SB -> RC : DLR DELIVERED (client_ref = attempt #2)
RC -> K : ntf.receipts
K -> RC : Receipt (Signaler)
RC -> T : SignalWorkflow(receipt(attempt #2, DELIVERED))
T -> WW : workflow task (signal)
WW --> T : CancelTimer; publish_status;\nCompleteWorkflow(DELIVERED via sms)

== Позднее подтверждение push ==
APP -> RC : POST /v1/acks {attempt #1}
RC -> K : ntf.receipts
K -> RC : Receipt (Signaler)
RC -> T : SignalWorkflow(receipt(attempt #1))
T --> RC : NotFound: workflow execution already completed
RC -> K : ntf.status: late ack (push)
RC -> RC : ntf_late_ack_total{channel=push} += 1

== Альтернатива: ack по push пришёл, когда activity SMS ещё не взята воркером ==
alt activity send(attempt #2) в task queue, не начата
  RC -> T : SignalWorkflow(receipt(attempt #1, DELIVERED))
  T -> WW : workflow task (signal)
  WW --> T : RequestCancelActivity(send #2)
  T -> T : activity отменена до старта:\nSMS не отправляется
  WW --> T : publish_status; CompleteWorkflow(DELIVERED via push)
end
@enduml
